{"id": "youth-grants-missed-board-approval", "title": "A review of one youth grant uncovered two more missed Board approvals", "seconds": 40.4, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "295722d5b69c12a1", "words": 118, "beats": [{"scene": "g", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A youth employment grant started at $24.75 million.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.06, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Who", "reviewed", "the", "grant?"], "sub": "San Francisco youth programs"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.38, 0.85, 1.13, 1.45, 1.55, 2.07, 2.34, 2.64, 2.91, 3.22]}, {"scene": "g", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "At that size, the City Charter required supervisors to approve it.", "t0": 4.18, "t1": 7.92, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$10 million", "label": "Board approval threshold"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.39, 0.99, 1.17, 1.43, 1.76, 2.17, 2.8, 2.92, 3.28]}, {"scene": "g", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The department said it had missed the rule.", "t0": 8.04, "t1": 9.76, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "analysis-210960", "kicker": "Analyst review", "text": "Required Board approval", "mark": "approval"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.58, 0.78, 0.88, 1.03, 1.27, 1.38]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Analysts checking the first grant found another one without the required vote.", "t0": 9.98, "t1": 13.54, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "analysis-210960", "kicker": "The second agreement", "text": "Black to the Future", "mark": "Future"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 0.77, 0.87, 1.15, 1.54, 1.81, 2.15, 2.28, 2.56, 2.67, 3.11]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In November 2021, supervisors approved the first grant and two amendments.", "t0": 13.66, "t1": 18.8, "shot": "s4", "visual": 